<title>CHILE: CHILE LEADS ARGENTINA 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>CHILE LEADS ARGENTINA 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile led Argentina 2-1 after the doubles match on the second day of their Davis Cup American zone group one second round tie on Saturday:</p>
<p>Marcelo Rios and Gabriel Silberstein (Chile) beat Javier Frana and Luis Lobo (Argentina) 3-6 7-6 (10-8) 4-6 6-3 6-2.</p>
